---
---

<section class="section" id="contact" data-animate>
  <div class="container">
    <p class="section-label">contato</p>

    <div class="contact-inner">
      <h2>Vamos conversar?</h2>
      <p class="contact-sub">
        Estou em busca de oportunidades como desenvolvedor backend junior.
        Se tiver uma vaga ou quiser bater um papo sobre tecnologia, é só chamar.
      </p>

      <a href="mailto:nicolascajueiro098@gmail.com" class="contact-email">
        nicolascajueiro098@gmail.com
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M7 17L17 7M17 7H7M17 7v10"/>
        </svg>
      </a>

      <div class="contact-links">
        <a href="https://github.com/DevNic0las" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="contact-social">
          GitHub ↗
        </a>
        <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/nicolas-cajueiro-6b4617273" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="contact-social">
          LinkedIn ↗
        </a>
        <a href="/cv.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="contact-social">
          Currículo ↗
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer class="footer">
  <div class="container footer-inner">
    <span class="footer-copy">© 2026 Nicolas</span>
    <span class="footer-built">
      feito com
      <a href="https://astro.build" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Astro</a>
    </span>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .contact-inner {
    max-width: 520px;
  }

  .contact-inner h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .contact-sub {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .contact-email {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: clamp(0.85rem, 3.5vw, 1rem);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-bottom: 0.25rem;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .contact-email:hover {
    border-color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .contact-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .contact-social {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .contact-social:hover {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 2rem 0;
  }

  .footer-inner {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .footer-copy,
  .footer-built {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .footer-built a {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .footer-built a:hover {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
</style>